7\. Evil Twin spoofing

A fake Wi-Fi access point imitates a legitimate Wi-Fi network.

Testing tools: Kismet, Wireshark, Wi-Fi analyzer.

Safe test: Scan your own wireless environment for duplicate SSIDs and compare BSSIDs, channels and security settings.

